      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "[Aside.] Here comes a flattering rascal; upon him\nWill I first work. He’s for his master,\nAn enemy to my son. How now, Pisanio!\nDoctor, your service for this time is ended;\nTake your own way.",
