      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PISANIO.\nAnd shall do.\nBut when to my good lord I prove untrue\nI’ll choke myself: there’s all I’ll do for you.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
